<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Orient says near NEC fan deal.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Orient says near NEC fan deal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Orient Co Ltd, a maker of wrist watches and DC motors, said on Monday it was negotiating a deal to sell DC motor fans to Japan's NEC Corp.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement if the deal was successful, it would begin the sales in August.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
